B.ajd=new A.V(B.ag,["1. Acceptance of Terms","By accessing and using SkyTrip, you accept these terms. If you disagree, do not use our services."],t.w)
B.aje=new A.V(B.ag,["2. Service Description","SkyTrip is a booking platform that connects guests with hotels and accommodations worldwide."],t.w)
B.aiT=new A.V(B.ag,["3. Bookings and Payments","All bookings are subject to availability. Payments are processed securely."],t.w)
B.aj8=new A.V(B.ag,["4. User Responsibilities","The user agrees to provide truthful data and to use the service lawfully."],t.w)
B.aiE=new A.V(B.ag,["5. Cancellation Policy","Free cancellation up to 24 hours before check-in, unless the accommodation's specific policy states otherwise."],t.w)
B.aiY=new A.V(B.ag,["6. Modifications","We reserve the right to modify these terms. Changes take effect upon publication."],t.w)
B.aj6=new A.V(B.ag,["7. Applicable Law","These terms are governed by Spanish law. Disputes will be resolved in the courts of Spain."],t.w)
